Visual Pianos protocol adaptation: qwerty.rs and the visual-pianos-qwerty.json
preset use MIT pv.rs mappings at 73e4d6b. Raw shared modifier state, debug
logging, unbounded indexing, and panic paths are replaced by validation,
worker-owned ordered pulses, generations and delivered-state cleanup.

